/*
 * White Whale :: klone run-only config for GAWRA2023_POMS_ADAPTATION_BSCAPTURE
 *
 * Passed last, after the study config (docs/compute_profiles.md):
 *
 *   nextflow run workflows/methylation -c config/GAWRA2023_POMS_ADAPTATION_BSCAPTURE.config \
 *       -c data/studies/GAWRA2023_POMS_ADAPTATION_BSCAPTURE/klone.run.config -profile klone
 *
 * It lives under data/studies/ because a study PR may only touch that folder
 * and config/<STUDY_ID>.config (whale check-study-scope).
 *
 * Why: 246 exome-capture libraries of 1.2-125 M pairs (median 52 M), 201 at
 * 2 x 100 bp and 45 at 2 x 150 bp, 2839 Gb in all. At DECICOMP2025's slowest
 * measured Bismark rate on klone (28.3 M pairs/h at 2 x 150 bp per 16-CPU
 * task on coenv compute, about 8.4 Gb/h) every library is an estimated
 * 3.0 h or less, so they fit the ckpt-all window (4 h 30 m) with room to
 * spare at 24 CPUs. BISMARK_ALIGN therefore stays on ckpt-all, where most
 * idle CPUs are, and only a library that fails twice (time-outs or
 * preemptions) moves to the lab's non-preemptible partitions on its third
 * attempt, alternating between coenv compute and srlab cpu-g2-mem2x by a
 * stable hash of the sample id, as PESTO2022's config does.
 *
 * Everything else stays on ckpt-all as the profile has it.
 */

process {
    withName: 'BISMARK_ALIGN' {
        scratch        = '/scr'
        // 30 x 24 CPUs at once on ckpt-all: 246 libraries in about a day.
        maxForks       = 30
        cpus           = { task.attempt >= 3 ? 16 : 24 }
        // Off ckpt-all, coenv compute is shared with two 8 GB head jobs and
        // FALLET2022's aligners, so 80 GB there.
        memory         = { task.attempt >= 3 ? (Math.floorMod(sample_id.hashCode(), 2) == 0 ? '80 GB' : '240 GB') : '64 GB' }
        time           = { task.attempt >= 3 ? '24h' : '4h 30m' }
        queue          = { task.attempt >= 3 ? (Math.floorMod(sample_id.hashCode(), 2) == 0 ? 'compute' : 'cpu-g2-mem2x') : 'ckpt-all' }
        clusterOptions = { task.attempt >= 3 ? (Math.floorMod(sample_id.hashCode(), 2) == 0 ? '--account=coenv' : '--account=srlab') : '--account=srlab' }
    }
}
